                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "07bd32ac-e9c8-3245-b299-e8ba24fbbbc1",
                        "entry_id": "930fc468-f6a3-39f4-bf4e-de9101f4bd01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. тот, кто убивает или убил человека или людей"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf83b22e-9cb1-40e9-bcd0-14be5e9391ca",
                                "sense_id": "07bd32ac-e9c8-3245-b299-e8ba24fbbbc1",
                                "text": "Ваш отец — диавол, и вы хотите исполнять похоти отца вашего. Он был человекоубийца от начала и не устоял в истине, ибо нет в нем истины. Когда говорит он ложь, говорит свое, ибо он — лжец и отец лжи."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1c10a531-fedb-4418-b590-ab1efbbb9232",
                        "source_entry_id": "930fc468-f6a3-39f4-bf4e-de9101f4bd01",
                        "source_sense_id": "07bd32ac-e9c8-3245-b299-e8ba24fbbbc1",
                        "target_lang_word": "homicide",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "homicide",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dba5c31d-8221-388d-8637-56ddc83ce9cd",
                                        "entry_id": "b6fbc25a-ef81-396c-8831-8d224a9d6dc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The killing of one person by another, whether premeditated or unintentional."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1c905dfb-80e3-3355-bddc-be92693f5b37",
                                        "entry_id": "b6fbc25a-ef81-396c-8831-8d224a9d6dc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who kills another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f19e11a5-a9d9-48f8-af74-00b812e1fda8",
                                                "sense_id": "1c905dfb-80e3-3355-bddc-be92693f5b37",
                                                "text": "Homicides in general and victorious warriors in particular are often obliged to perform a variety of ceremonies for the purpose of ridding them of the dangerous ghosts of their victims."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4757f6e3-3a9a-37f1-9552-e05f3e8d0f86",
                                        "entry_id": "b6fbc25a-ef81-396c-8831-8d224a9d6dc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A victim of homicide; a person who has been unlawfully killed by someone else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "countable",
                                            "jargon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5752aa1-125b-41a9-9c01-09c1465570e7",
                                                "sense_id": "4757f6e3-3a9a-37f1-9552-e05f3e8d0f86",
                                                "text": "“She was a hippie kid. How hard would you work a case like that?”\n“As hard as anyone else,” said Goddard. There was an irritated note in his voice. “She was a homicide. She got what every homicide investigation gets.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ab5b429-b5ac-4ba0-8980-352e9210063b",
                                                "sense_id": "4757f6e3-3a9a-37f1-9552-e05f3e8d0f86",
                                                "text": "We don't even know the woman was a homicide. Didn't they say it was possible they both jumped?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f8d242c-d873-4eb6-8347-40b00588a86f",
                                                "sense_id": "4757f6e3-3a9a-37f1-9552-e05f3e8d0f86",
                                                "text": "The medical examiner was behind on autopsies and cranky, so we didn't even know if the old guy in the pool was a homicide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ec15ab1-d100-3f2e-bb02-8e9647d9d153",
                                        "entry_id": "b6fbc25a-ef81-396c-8831-8d224a9d6dc3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The department within a police force that investigates cases of homicide."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "896bf518-1009-4f2f-91bf-56a1d62bac1d",
                        "source_entry_id": "930fc468-f6a3-39f4-bf4e-de9101f4bd01",
                        "source_sense_id": "07bd32ac-e9c8-3245-b299-e8ba24fbbbc1",
                        "target_lang_word": "homicide",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "homicide",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9192f49e-5360-3641-bd0d-5de3981b2afa",
                                        "entry_id": "b2730093-5c4f-3b66-9b71-8346914aa0c7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fait de tuer un être humain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c814b1e2-2e15-46be-88b4-6970cc3fa2a6",
                                                "sense_id": "9192f49e-5360-3641-bd0d-5de3981b2afa",
                                                "text": "La violence par armes à feu est un problème endémique croissant dans la plus grande ville du Canada. En 2018, le taux d’homicides à Toronto a dépassé celui de New York."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d34cb18c-7f51-4f15-90e6-ebac97ef8496",
                                                "sense_id": "9192f49e-5360-3641-bd0d-5de3981b2afa",
                                                "text": "L’homicide est un crime très grave."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9add72d5-f31a-456e-95cb-394c1722be18",
                                                "sense_id": "9192f49e-5360-3641-bd0d-5de3981b2afa",
                                                "text": "homicide involontaire"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "homicide",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e595872-5df4-3f63-9cf0-e75c247a29d4",
                                        "entry_id": "81cfa3ca-ef87-3b06-a380-c4001036064a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Meurtrier d’un être humain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "824468c9-49b9-46fd-9e8c-887a409e6ccb",
                                                "sense_id": "8e595872-5df4-3f63-9cf0-e75c247a29d4",
                                                "text": "Il est dit dans l’évangile que ni les adultères, ni les fornicateurs, ni les homicides n’entreront dans le royaume des cieux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffcebc2f-8325-44db-9dda-4dd60a579f4b",
                                                "sense_id": "8e595872-5df4-3f63-9cf0-e75c247a29d4",
                                                "text": "Nous ne sommes pas non plus absolument esclaves de la fatalité de nos instincts. Dieu nous a donné à tous un certain instinct assez puissant pour les combattre. […] On objecterait en vain les idiots, les fous et une certaine variété d'homicides qui sont sous l'empire d'une monomanie furieuse, et qui rentrent par conséquent dans la catégorie des fous et des idiots. Toute règle a son exception qui la confirme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "homicide",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6629b4ea-b8fa-3104-a12d-c888abae4896",
                                        "entry_id": "843da39d-d786-30a0-a99d-51df4520be40",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Meurtrier d’un être humain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "formal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1be18a35-c911-4459-9887-f3bfed77ffe1",
                                                "sense_id": "6629b4ea-b8fa-3104-a12d-c888abae4896",
                                                "text": "C’est une race […] peu scrupuleuse dans le choix de ses moyens, peu véridique et volontiers voleuse, pillarde et homicide."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c465182-5398-42ee-b918-3ff18c947979",
                                                "sense_id": "6629b4ea-b8fa-3104-a12d-c888abae4896",
                                                "text": "Va-t-il me falloir enregistrer que Castelsarrasin, centre d’un obscurantisme homicide, évolue à rebours de la civilisation ? Non !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a986613-a875-4845-8ad5-3c6bb0285983",
                                                "sense_id": "6629b4ea-b8fa-3104-a12d-c888abae4896",
                                                "text": "— Un des plus grands orateurs de la chaire chrétienne a dit, de nos jours, à l’occasion de Voltaire, que l’impie est à-la-fois déicide, homicide et suicide ; […] ; homicide, en ce qu’il tue les âmes par le poison de ses doctrines anti-religieuses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
